lines+=['','For each computed cell conditioning.csv reports raw σ², 2σ²/λ_r, full δ=||AQ||, compressed norm, structural rank/dimJ, λ_r resolution, weak singular pair, included minimum gap and last-zero lookahead. Tiny uncached λ_r and unresolved weak σ retain explicit status; their ratios are blank. METHOD.md states the precision branches, normalization and source scope.','','|ζ m|cut|dimJ|δ|N_A(2)−dimJ|σmin|λr|','|---:|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
